","text":"「UTB＋ Vol.18」が発売です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分でも見たことのない松村沙友理が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ、チェックしてください(੭ु´͈ ᐜ `͈)੭ु⁾⁾"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、また(੭ु´͈ ᐜ `͈)੭ु⁾⁾"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さよなら～♡"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-38230":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2017/04/22/5330426/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お久しぶりのブログになってしまいましたすみません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶賛舞台あさひなぐの稽古中です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"薙刀、初めての防具、殺陣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しいですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このままいくと、きっと生駒はもっとガリガリやろうになりそうです。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日汗だらだらで稽古してます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不安ばかりですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっとこれを乗り越えられたら、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分も、乃木坂の見方も変わる気がします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山のメンバーが舞台という所で頑張ってくれています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、私も頑張らないと！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","t